<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\SE\cricket.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\元木町夕方の道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―I slipped quietly out of the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sun had already set, and the western sky was faintly tinged with crimson.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Casually covering my face with my sleeve so that the people I passed would see as little of it as possible, I hurried to that place.<PG>
But once I met him, what should I talk about?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How long would we be able to see each other?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, before that, what did he think of me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I said something that somehow offended him, this precious chance would be ruined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking about such things only now, I walked on.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
Just a little farther to the place we had agreed on―
{PAUSE ""}
Suddenly, that voice reached my ears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\懐かしの里.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There stood Ko-sama, without the Noh mask, in perfectly ordinary clothes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, so it is you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. You look like a different person."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, it's just... the lovely kimono, and your hair..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh... yes, I made myself a little prettier... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Y-you know, I'm </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>reeeeeeeally </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>free!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hahaha! So you were!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had had the time to prepare, but my heart had been anything but free.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right up to the very last moment, I had agonized over what to wear.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, is it all right to take the mask off?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's this dark already. To the people of Tokyo, my hair and eyes shouldn't stand out much."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you noticed my clothes and my hair right away, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I grew up in the mountains, so my eyes are good. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Do my eyes and hair stand out?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">No, not that much, to my eyes..."</STYLE><PG>
The western sky had gone nearly dark too, and there were only gas lamps here and there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That, and a mere token of light from the moon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unless I came close enough to hear his breathing, I could not clearly tell it was <STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The streets of Tokyo, now gone completely quiet―
{PAUSE ""}
What reached my ears was <STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE>'s breathing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Shall we go, then? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Uh, how late can you stay out today?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I can stay as late as you like. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You know me, I'm―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Reeally free?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though this was only our second meeting, <STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE> had gotten ahead of my joke.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow, it made me happy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\川辺.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―We walked as far as the river, and the two of us sat down on its bank.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, wait, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kikyo-dono</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, please use this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE> held out the red vestments to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're in such lovely clothes. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Please put this down to sit on."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
And before hearing my answer, <STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE> spread the red vestments on the ground.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Thank you very much. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Then I'll accept your kind offer..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I accepted his kindness and sat down on the red vestments.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
A slightly chilly wind off the river.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It cooled, just a little, my body, flushed from the thick kimono I was not used to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-sama</STYLE>'s breathing, too, was drowned out by the sound of the river.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
